  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFEX globally</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFEX globally</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Freedom of Expression Exchange (IFEX) is a network of 81 free expression organisations active in around 60 countries. IFEX is managed by the Candian Journalists of Free Expression (CJFE). The overall objective of IFEX is to defend and promote freedom of expression and opinion worldwide, and to develop the capacity of free expression organizations based in the South.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Freedom of Expression Exchange (IFEX) &#xe4;r ett n&#xe4;tverk med drygt 80 YF-organisationer fr&#xe5;n runt 60 l&#xe4;nder som medlemmar. IFEX &#xe4;r baserat i Kanada och drivs inom ramen f&#xf6;r Canadian Journalists of Free Expression (CJFE). Syftet &#xe4;r att genom samverkan effektivisera f&#xf6;rsvar och fr&#xe4;mjande av yttrande- och &#xe5;siktsfrihet globalt samt st&#xe4;rka kapacitet hos YF-org i Syd. St&#xf6;d sedan flera &#xe5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
